Committed so this directory exists in a fresh clone.

`CLAUDE.md` names `reports/` as one of the paths the container mount keeps resolvable on both
sides, and `.pre-commit-config.yaml`'s doc-references hook refuses an index document that points
at something absent -- which `pre-commit run --all-files` has been failing on since before
Step 9. `.gitignore` excludes `reports/*.html`, not the directory, so the reports that
`src/monitoring/drift.py` writes here stay out of git while the path itself does not have to be
re-created by hand.
